  "reviews": [
    {
      "author": "Iyad K.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "Excellent bakery with truly outstanding desserts. Their banoffee pie is easily the best in town — fresh, rich, perfectly balanced, and absolutely delicious. The crust, banana, cream, and caramel all come together beautifully without being too heavy.",
      "source_ref": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2xaRGFWbGhaWHBZVlVSRmNYWkdVMmQ1WWxSRFVFRRAB"
    },
    {
      "author": "Ama G.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "The Matilda cake was AMAZING!!! the sponge was very sponge the frosting was so smooth!!! was sooo delicious!!!!!! & not too sweet!!!!!!! ❣️❣️ would definitely order again",
      "source_ref": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pJdFQzbHlUR2c1UTJkUGRFZHhRalJITms0NGNYYxAB"
    },
    {
      "author": "Donna O.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "The place is very cozy and relaxing. It's like an italian or french ambiance. The cakes are superb! But our favorite is the Banoffee pie, the mango cheesecake is delicious as well. They have a wide variety of cakes that will soothe you palate. Heaven for people with sweet…",
      "source_ref": "ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSURtMkwtZ3hRRRAB"
    },
    {
      "author": "Aminuddin S.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "Hi it was an amazing evening with lovely cakes. I tried carrot cake and chocolate cake it was outstanding quality and fresh. Keep going and best luck",
      "source_ref": "Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT25kRGQwUXpTemR1TlhsbGJuTXhUbWhYYlRsSFJFRRAB"
    },
    {
      "author": "Hasan H.",
      "stars": 5,
      "text": "The cakes are so good that when three of us go together we order four cakes ! I tried many of their cakes including Orange Cake, Lemon Cake, Saint Sébastien ( Basque) Cake, Chocolate Cake, Berries Cake, Carrot Cake and more. The place is small and feels like a family business…",
      "source_ref": "ChZDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnSUNCdXAzMk1nEAE"
    }
  ],
